+### Proof-local extension inventory
+
+1. `syntax Int ::= fibFrom(Int,Int,Int,Int) [function]` is a
+   result-bearing definitional summary, not an operational rewrite.
+2. For `N <= 0`, `fibFrom(A,B,C,N) = A`.
+3. For `N > 0`, it becomes
